{"symbol":"GPW.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T19:50:40Z","info":{"address1":"ul. Ksiazeca 4","city":"Warsaw","zip":"00-498","country":"Poland","phone":"48 22 628 3232","fax":"48 22 537 7790","website":"https://www.gpw.pl","industry":"Financial Data & Stock Exchanges","industryKey":"financial-data-stock-exchanges","industryDisp":"Financial Data & Stock Exchanges","sector":"Financial Services","sectorKey":"financial-services","sectorDisp":"Financial Services","longBusinessSummary":"Gielda Papierów Wartosciowych w Warszawie S.A., together with its subsidiaries, operates a stock exchange in Poland. It operates through Financial, Commodity, and Other segments. The company trades in equities; equity-related financial instruments; other cash markets instruments, such as structured products, investment certificates, and exchange traded fund units; derivatives; corporate, municipal, co-operative, treasury, and mortgage bonds; debt instruments; and agricultural commodities, as well as provides listing, trading, clearing services for shares and bonds, and information services. It offers post-trade services, such as depository, clearing and settlement services; tools based on artificial intelligence to automate and digitise processes for the transport, shipment and logistics; WIBID and WIBOR benchmark calculation and distribution services; capital market education, promotion, and information activities; and training services, as well as leases and maintains office space. In addition, the company trades in electricity, gas, greenhouse gas emission allowances, electricity certificates of origin and energy efficiency certificates, and agricultural and food commodities, as well as engages in the operation of the register of certificates of origin of electricity and the register of guarantees of origin. Further, it operates as an exchange settlement system for transactions in exchange-traded commodities. The company operates in various markets, such as GPW Main Market, NewConnect, Catalyst, and Treasury BondSpot Poland, as well as the markets operated by Towarowa Gielda Energii S.A. and InfoEngine S.A. Gielda Papierów Wartosciowych w Warszawie S.A. was incorporated in 1991 and is based in Warsaw, Poland.","fullTimeEmployees":591,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Tomasz  Bardzilowski","title":"President of Management Board & CEO","fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":1454600,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Slawomir  Panasiuk","title":"Deputy CEO & Vice President of the Management Board","fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":1314500,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Marcin  Rulnicki","age":49,"title":"Member of the Management Board","yearBorn":1976,"fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":1076300,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Michal  Kobza","title":"Member of the Management Board for Growth & Sales","fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":1077900,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Dominika  Niewiadomska-Siniecka","title":"Member of Management Board","fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":561000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Dariusz  Wosztak","title":"Director of Financial Department","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Malgorzata  Gola-Radwan","title":"Chief Accountant","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Lukasz  Kucharski","title":"Head of Investor Relations","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Robert  Stankiewicz","title":"Director of Communication & Marketing","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0}],"compensationAsOfEpochDate":1767139200,"irWebsite":"http://www.gpw.pl/relacje_inwestorskie_en","executiveTeam":[],"maxAge":86400,"priceHint":2,"previousClose":97.1,"open":97.1,"dayLow":95.55,"dayHigh":97.25,"regularMarketPreviousClose":97.1,"regularMarketOpen":97.1,"regu